## CI-shape note

rust-static/rust-test/ci.sh gain explicit `--no-default-features`: required
because embedding on a fresh checkout (gitignored dist) panics tauri-build
codegen; lts-desktop is the only workspace crate with [features], so the flag
changes no other crate's graph — these jobs stay byte-identical to the pre-flip
compiles. The default-ON path is gated by platform-compile (pnpm build then
cargo check -p lts-desktop --all-targets) and desktop-smoke (tauri build,
which embeds today too).
